# Alternative proof of Maschke's theorem for complex representations
%%%
tag := "Chapter4/Discussion_after_Theorem4.6.3"
number := false
%%%

Theorems 4.6.2 and 4.6.3 imply Maschke's theorem for complex representations (Theorem 4.1.1). Thus, we have obtained a new proof of this theorem over the field of complex numbers.

